# iCloud Drive duplicates: "05_case14-....transcript 2.txt", "index 3". iCloud makes them
# inside this folder and evicts their contents, so they are dataless placeholders and
# `git add -A` blocks forever trying to read one. Never commit them.
* [0-9].*
* [0-9]
